{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的大号白色文字段落，字号大、亮度高、占据主要视野；下方金色音符动画较暗，右上角阶段目录是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他喜欢和对方待在一起，希望对方承诺以后也不会改变，想确认这份亲密能够持续。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"开心、眷恋、期待，隐约有不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"对未来失去彼此的具体担忧，例如害怕有一天对方不再需要自己；以及幸福中逐渐掺入悲伤、越想克制越难受的心理变化。这些需要继续读后面的文字才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字过长，一块里连续包含了好几层心理变化。\",\n    \"核心感受并非由一个突出的短语直接表达，需要顺着长句继续读，才能确认开心与不安之间的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bce163b5-8e63-4cd7-a675-9723b99845aa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T015040855831Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:51:07.607725+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fc61b6fd8d8ef3ed014b10fb52ffb1362e398bc4dabbc48029b463f16677f676", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3